  displayName: Portal Controller
  description: "An absolute unit of a control monolith. Mount it in front of the
    framed aperture (within 8 m), wire serious power, set a NAME and a CODE; two
    portals whose name AND code match link across any distance. The spinning dial
    means it is alive. Charging costs little \u2014 an open aperture drains by its
    size, so the big ones must earn their keep."
